  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HELP 500 WOMEN VICTIMS OF ARMED CONFLICTS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will help distribute 100 bags of rice among the Internally Displaced Persons (IDPs), distribute 500 numbers of blankets to 500 women, provide 200 mattresses among their families and distribute detergents for washing clothes to 500 women. The project will help women children with mattresses, rice supplies, and detergents for washing to ameliorate conditions of women affected by armed conflicts and criminal violence which has led to a surge in raids on communities in Zamfara State.</narrative>
  </description>
